#### environment
.env
node_modules/
.scratch/
!.scratch/directory-keeper

#### implementation repositories, fetched or adopted by /hora-setup
/*-backend*/
/*-frontend*/

# A repository adopted under its own directory name matches neither pattern
# above, so /hora-setup appends one literal entry per declared `Directory`
# here. Left out, the whole repository gets committed into this one, and
# nothing says so until somebody reads `git status`.

#### skills equipped from @openreachtech/ai-agent-skills by equip-skills.sh (regenerated, not authored here)
#
# Ignore everything under .claude/skills/ and name this repository's own back
# in. The package does prefix its skills (hb-/hf-/hc-), but those prefixes
# have already changed twice, and each time the old denylist kept matching
# nothing while saying nothing. An allowlist of the six we author here cannot
# fail that way, whatever the package renames next.
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/bank-id/
!/.claude/skills/hora/
!/.claude/skills/hora-accept/
!/.claude/skills/hora-build/
!/.claude/skills/hora-plan/
!/.claude/skills/hora-setup/

